ind":"update","title":"The Great Jack-O Has Arrived! Next Fest Demo Update","summary":"Meet The Great Jack-O!Something wicked has taken root.The Great Jack-O is a brand-new Halloween-themed boss battle, bringing a little spooky season chaos to Dodgeball Blast!Take on this massive jack-o'-lantern, dodge his attacks, and send those dodgeballs flying if you want to make it out in one piece.What’s new in the updated demo:New Boss Battle: The Great Jack-O Face off against an all-new Halloween-themed boss!A Spooky New Battle New visuals, attacks, music, and plenty of Halloween atmospher","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T01:30:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223081","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3261250-1844115010493622","game_id":"steam-3261250","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for Playtesting Dodgeball Blast!","summary":"The Dodgeball Blast Steam Playtest has officially come to an end!A huge THANK YOU to everyone who requested access, jumped into the game, shared the Playtest, or followed along during the event.Getting Dodgeball Blast out into the world is an exciting milestone after years of development, and every bit of support along the way means a lot.Now it’s back to work! I’ll be continuing to polish the game, squash bugs, make improvements, and get everything ready for our next big event:STEAM NEXT FEST –","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T01:41:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3261250-1843481262691069","game_id":"steam-3261250","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dodgeball Blast Playtest is LIVE!","summary":"It’s time!The Dodgeball Blast Steam Playtest is officially LIVE and playable now through September 16!Jump in and experience fast-paced dodgeball combat, explore the overworld, take on massive bosses, tackle minigames, discover new abilities, solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and more!PLAYTEST DETAILSSeptember 10–16 100% FREE Available now on SteamThis Playtest is a chance for us to put Dodgeball Blast into the hands of more players, find bugs, gather feedback, and make the game even better as we ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T04:05:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3261250-1842846814449518","game_id":"steam-3261250","kind":"announcement","title":"Dodgeball Blast Playtest Signups Are NOW OPEN!","summary":"The Dodgeball Blast Steam Playtest is almost here!We're excited to finally invite players to jump into Dodgeball Blast and help us get ready for Steam Next Fest!Playtest signups are OPEN NOW, and the Playtest will be available from: September 10–16During the Playtest, you'll be able to experience Dodgeball Blast's fast-paced dodgeball combat, explore the overworld, take on massive bosses, tackle minigames, discover abilities and secrets, and more.How to join:Click Request Access on the Dodgeball","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T18:02:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449518","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3261250-1837955055365116","game_id":"steam-3261250","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 2.0 - Bigfoot Boss Battle","summary":"Demo Update Now Live!Hello everyone!A brand-new update for the Dodgeball Blast demo is now available!This version is built from a much newer beta build than the previous demo, bringing a significant amount of polish, gameplay improvements, bug fixes, and quality-of-life updates throughout the experience.What's new?An additional boss battle has been added, bringing the demo to a total of 4 playable bosses! Improved gameplay, balancing, visuals, and overall polish.Numerous bug fixes and refinement","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T04:30:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055365116","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3261250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3261250":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3261250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z"},"4257610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:41Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3261250","app_id":3261250,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0183a1b744ffab5dfd6bd36957a629849a1f97dd46554431ae67055948f80d27","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"《Dodgeball Blast》는 가볍고 액션이 넘치는 보스 러시 게임!\r\n피하고, 잡고, 던지면서 짜릿한 전투를 펼쳐라! 각기 다른 능력을 가진 강력한 보스들과 맞서 싸우며, 궁극의 도지볼 마스터가 되어보자!","publishers":[{"name"